sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User
  participant App as AI Route
  participant Guard as Risk/PII Guard
  participant Search as Approved Content Retrieval
  participant Model as AI Provider
  participant DB as Conversation Store

  User->>App: Question
  App->>App: Auth, rate/cost/feature checks
  App->>Guard: Normalize, detect PII/risk/injection
  alt prohibited or sensitive
    Guard-->>App: Refuse/warn/handoff
    App-->>User: Safe response
  else permitted
    Guard-->>App: Redacted query
    App->>Search: Filter published, locale, country, date
    Search-->>App: Approved chunks + source metadata
    alt insufficient evidence
      App-->>User: Abstain + handoff
    else supported
      App->>Model: System prompt + delimited untrusted chunks
      Model-->>App: Structured answer
      App->>App: Validate schema/citations/output
      App->>DB: Store redacted, short-retention record
      App-->>User: Answer + citations + date + disclaimer
    end
  end
